{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Dodge</strong> is a frantic, vaporwave-themed bullet hell where you cannot shoot. Master the dodge to survive the impossible challenges that a mysterious Voice throws at you... Or watch your death counter ascend to infinity</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CORES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pickup the 'cores' on each level to advance. But beware, some have unexpected effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/a07c8e4822eefbc94d9a2975d5561b83.poster.avif?t=1761391437\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/a07c8e4822eefbc94d9a2975d5561b83.webm?t=1761391437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/a07c8e4822eefbc94d9a2975d5561b83.mp4?t=1761391437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DODGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move and pass through enemies to dodge them, colliding with any red shape will kill you</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLOR CHANGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only survive if you adapt, you will need to change color between different zones to avoid dying</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/3e2818b74456c65939b9ed7512cf8e2c.poster.avif?t=1761391437\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/3e2818b74456c65939b9ed7512cf8e2c.webm?t=1761391437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/3e2818b74456c65939b9ed7512cf8e2c.mp4?t=1761391437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHANGE SIZE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One pill makes you larger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And one pill makes you small</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>USE YOUR SHIELD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect yourself from the enemies with a rotatory shield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/071550215184c59a9777027b8ac57a8e.poster.avif?t=1761391437\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/071550215184c59a9777027b8ac57a8e.webm?t=1761391437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/071550215184c59a9777027b8ac57a8e.mp4?t=1761391437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIFFICULTY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Dodge</strong> will be a challenge, that's why we've kindly decided to remind you how many times you've already died :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/496801a065c07d0de1eff86a0e7ce8fa.webp?t=1761391437\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/496801a065c07d0de1eff86a0e7ce8fa.poster.avif?t=1761391437\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=658 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666410?t=1761391437","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/84e185a8b4f46fb4e27589e2f2b47f14d7c57578/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761391437","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/b7ee6c18b32c4711a31df527c265e92171b62c86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761391437","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/b7ee6c18b32c4711a31df527c265e92171b62c86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761391437","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Dodge</strong> is a frantic, vaporwave-themed bullet hell where you cannot shoot. Master the dodge to survive the impossible challenges that a mysterious Voice throws at you... Or watch your death counter ascend to infinity</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CORES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pickup the 'cores' on each level to advance. But beware, some have unexpected effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/a07c8e4822eefbc94d9a2975d5561b83.poster.avif?t=1761391437\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/a07c8e4822eefbc94d9a2975d5561b83.webm?t=1761391437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666410/extras/a07c8e4822eefbc94d9a2975d5561b83.mp4?t=1761391437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DODGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move and pass through enemies to dodge 